BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314039666@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260422T031510Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260422T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260422T101500
SUMMARY:🌎EARTH DAY clean up at Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\n**This is a special event for Earth Day 2026. We
  will be collecting trash along our usual hiking route. Trash bags and dis
 posable gloves will be provided**\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 
 miles. We will be walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear
 \, long pants & socks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo
 .gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle R
 ock Trail Parking Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go 
 pass the Highlawn and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of
  the curve to your right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\
 , streams\, and valleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, a
 nd Montclair\, New Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densel
 y populated county in the most densely populated state in the country\, th
 e Reservation is mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system w
 ithin its borders.\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prio
 r to start time.**\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaime
 r: If you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible 
 for your own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable 
 in case of injury or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extrem
 e weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314039666/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260330T161841Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260330T161841Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314392167@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260422T031510Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260424T110000
SUMMARY:JOIN US for a walk along  West Essex Trail in Verona 
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US for a walk along West Essex Trail in Ver
 ona\n\nWe will walk a semi-paved path.\n\nWe will be walking on a trail in
  a wooded area\, so wear appropriate footwear and clothing. Example - long
  pants & socks\, and you may also want to use bug spray.\n\nWe will meet i
 n front of the trail entrance. Park on Fairview Avenue just north of Veron
 a High School\, 151 Fairview Ave\, Verona\, NJ 07044.\n\nWest Essex Trail 
 follows a short distance of the former rail bed of the Caldwell Branch on 
 the old Erie-Lackawanna Railroad. The trail runs between the Essex–Passa
 ic county line in Little Falls and Arnold Way in Verona. The trail crosses
  a trestle over the Peckman River. Although situated in the heavily urbani
 zed part of the state\, the trail passes through sections of woodland\, pr
 oviding a short escape from the surrounding congestion.\n\n**Please make s
 ure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.**\n\nDisclaimer: If 
 you join us for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for yo
 ur own preparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in cas
 e of injury or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weat
 her.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314392167/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260421T003116Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T003116Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_314397316@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260422T031510Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260425T113000
SUMMARY:🚶 Richard W DeKorte Park
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nLet's Walk!! in the NJ Meadowlands\n\nJoin us fo
 r a flat 3+ mile walk along the nature trails near Lyndhurst. This area is
  ideal for birders and has great views of the New York city skyline\n\nFor
  more information\, please review the AllTrails link:\n[Shorewalk\, Marsh\
 , Transco\, Sawmill\, and Lyndhurst Nature Trails](https://www.alltrails.c
 om/trail/us/new-jersey/shorewalk-marsh-transco-sawmill-and-lyndhurst-natur
 e-trails?u=i&sh=vgtzxk)\n\n**This is not entirely a paved path.** Please b
 e prepared for muddy spots\, rocks and tree roots. You should wear hiking 
 shoes/boots and bring a walking stick or trekking poles (if they help you)
 .\n\nInclement weather may cancel this event. Please check the event page 
 for comments prior to leaving for the meetup.\n\n**Disclaimer:** If you jo
 in this event\, please understand that you are responsible for your own pr
 eparedness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of inju
 ry or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314397316/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260421T115203Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260421T115203Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
